# Models Directory

This directory contains trained model artifacts (.pth files).

## Model Types
- `model_state.pth` or `cnn-*.pth`: CNN classifier
- `model_state_art.pth` or `art-*.pth`: Fuzzy ART classifier  
- `model_state_ffn.pth` or `ffn-*.pth`: Feedforward classifier
- `autoencoder.pth`: Class-conditional autoencoder
- `ood_params.pth`: OOD detection parameters (Mahalanobis)

## Note
These files are typically large (>1MB) and are excluded from git via .gitignore.
Train models using `python -m src.first_ai.cli train {cnn|art|ffn}`.
